  "reasoning": "The defendant illegally removed and sold two ancient soapberry trees that were protected as historic trees. This constitutes theft of property (the trees) and also violates statutes protecting forest resources, i.e., illegal felling and destruction of protected trees. Therefore the appropriate charges are theft and illegal felling/destruction of forest resources.",
